    "description": "System Support Holdings Inc., together with its subsidiaries, engages in the cloud integration, system integration, outsourcing, product, and overseas businesses in Japan and North America. The company provides cloud implementation and migration support, cloud environment setup, operational support, and license resale services for Amazon Web Services (AWS), ServiceNow, Microsoft Azure, and Google Cloud, as well as AI and data-related services. It also offers IT consulting, system design, development, implementation, operation and maintenance services, ERP implementation support, database infrastructure construction services, cloud services through proprietary data centers, nearshore services, and data analysis input services. In addition, the company develops, customizes, and sells software products, including Tate Yakusha, a construction information management system; Shugyo Yakusha, an attendance and work management system; SHIFTEE, a cloud-based shift management system; MOS, a mobile ordering system; and PinMap, a customer information mapping service. Further, it provides system integration services, payroll and accounting outsourcing services, and recruitment services in North America. System Support Holdings Inc. was formerly known as System Support Inc. and changed its name to System Support Holdings Inc. in January 2025. System Support Holdings Inc. was incorporated in 1980 and is headquartered in Kanazawa, Japan."
